import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 975 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 8 | A-Path-for-All Guarantee System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 975 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 8 | A-Path-for-All Guarantee System","no":975,"module":5,"tags":["Anti-Regression","Mechanism 8","A Path for All","Guarantee System","Floor"],"related":["08-A-Path-for-All Guarantee System","912-A-Path-for-All Guarantee","43-Education Guarantee Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0975_模块5-机制八-人人有路保障体系.md","filePath":"en/0975_模块5-机制八-人人有路保障体系.md"}'),n={name:"en/0975_模块5-机制八-人人有路保障体系.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,c,u){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-975-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-mechanism-8-a-path-for-all-guarantee-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 975 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 8 | A-Path-for-All Guarantee System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-975-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-mechanism-8-a-path-for-all-guarantee-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 975 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · Mechanism 8 | A-Path-for-All Guarantee System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 08, 43, 37</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-last-floor-is-that-no-one-is-locked-out" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the last floor is that no one is locked out <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-last-floor-is-that-no-one-is-locked-out" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the last floor is that no one is locked out&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Mechanisms 5 through 7 governed distribution, vitality, and the strong respectively. But there is another regression called &quot;dead-end&quot;: some clan, some planet consciousness, some individual with the worst inborn aptitude, slowly finds himself in civilization with simply no door upward. The A-Path-for-All Guarantee System is the anti-regression system&#39;s floor project. It is the six top-level axioms&#39; most direct landing: the anti-predation axiom requires roads be built, not snatched; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires 99% full coverage, not one door missing; the collective-ascension axiom requires stragglers be pulled up, not left behind; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the guarantee itself leave no causal hidden wound; the law-first axiom requires the &quot;a path for all&quot; promise never retcon; the universal equal infinite law pushes this to the extreme — since every being inherently possesses basic infinite power, &quot;no road&quot; theoretically should not exist, and the guarantee system only cashes this inherent infinity into visible doors.</p><h2 id="i-mechanism-content" tabindex="-1">I. Mechanism Content <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-mechanism-content" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Mechanism Content&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Mechanism 8 stipulates: the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization guarantees all beings — human men and women, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, cosmic-origin bodies, and multiverse residual civilizations — a complete path from Sense-Condensed Realm to higher realms, including education, medicine, housing, resources, mentors, and trial-and-error opportunities in six aspects. Any being, due to inborn aptitude, birth, clan, or planetary environment, feeling &quot;nowhere to go,&quot; may apply with one click, and the guarantee system must within a time limit open a personalized path for him.</p><h2 id="ii-operation" tabindex="-1">II. Operation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-operation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Operation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Guarantee runs as a six-gate closed loop:</p><ol><li><strong>Education gate</strong>: the symbiotic education system matches every being with an entry method and basic perception training;</li><li><strong>Medical gate</strong>: the symbiotic medical system repairs cultivation hidden wounds, not abandoning treatment due to birth differences;</li><li><strong>Housing gate</strong>: safe cultivation space is available to all;</li><li><strong>Resource gate</strong>: basic cultivation energy is disbursed per Axiom 6&#39;s floor, decoupled from contribution;</li><li><strong>Mentor gate</strong>: every being may apply for an Alaya-Network-matched guide;</li><li><strong>Trial-and-error gate</strong>: early breakthrough failures are not punished and not sentenced to death, allowing repeated road-testing.</li></ol><p>All six gates open counts as &quot;has a road.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-anti-regression-principle" tabindex="-1">III. Anti-Regression Principle <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-anti-regression-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Anti-Regression Principle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The dead-end type&#39;s regression marker is &quot;humble clans no longer produce talents,&quot; and over time civilization loses new blood. This mechanism&#39;s defense points:</p><ul><li><strong>One-click application</strong>: the road is not waiting for the strong&#39;s charity, but institutionalized floor; the weak may also actively speak up;</li><li><strong>All six gates open counts</strong>: giving education without medicine, or resources without a mentor, does not count as &quot;has a road,&quot; eliminating half-baked guarantees;</li><li><strong>Meshed with Axiom 6</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent to all, and the guarantee system only cashes it into doors; the easygoing flat-laying also has a door to walk, and strivers and Youth Supremes have doors to rush through.</li></ul><p>The old cosmos&#39;s &quot;road&quot; was snatched, with those who snatched it mocking those who did not; the Anchor Symbiotic &quot;road&quot; is built to the door, and knocking gets an answer.</p><h2 id="iv-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">IV. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The six gates&#39; receipt status is audited by Mechanism 4; any gate long blocked or application shunted, the people layer may directly report; guarantee standards are legislated by the Anchor Council, and Mechanism 3&#39;s Symbiotic Court accepts constitutional review of &quot;refused roads.&quot; The guarantee system&#39;s ultimate supervisor is every being himself — whether the door is underfoot, one step tells.</p><h2 id="appendix-a-concrete-scenario-—-a-small-clan-that-cannot-see-a-future" tabindex="-1">Appendix: A Concrete Scenario — A Small Clan That &quot;Cannot See a Future&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#appendix-a-concrete-scenario-—-a-small-clan-that-cannot-see-a-future" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Appendix: A Concrete Scenario — A Small Clan That &quot;Cannot See a Future&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some small clan living on a barren energy belt, with the whole clan naturally slow-perceiving; in the old cosmos such a clan would sooner or later be swallowed by surrounding strong ones. In the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the clan leader applies with one click for a &quot;path assessment.&quot; Education gate: the network customizes an entry method suited to slow perception; medical gate: repairs generations of accumulated perception hidden wounds; resource gate: basic cultivation energy arrives per Axiom 6&#39;s floor; mentor gate: matches an old cultivator also from slow-perception stock; housing and trial-and-error gates open simultaneously. Three epochs later, this small clan produces its first Law-Origin Realm cultivator — not a sudden talent leap, but the road finally built to their feet. The old cosmos asks &quot;why has this clan not died&quot;; the Anchor Symbiotic asks &quot;why did no one before ask what they needed.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: placing guarantees on those most in need, avoiding quality seedlings dying from resource misallocation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: roads built to the door, beings need not prey to open doors, and predatory cultivation loses its soil</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems only the protagonist has a road, others as fertilizer; Heng Yuan Zhou everyone has a road, 99% coverage</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: human men and women, Youth Supremes, alien beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness, and multiverse residual civilizations all have a road</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated multiversal civilizations automatically gain six-gate guarantees; the larger the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, the denser the doors</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The A-Path-for-All Guarantee System is the anti-regression system&#39;s last floor brick. The first five mechanisms govern the strong, distribution, and vitality; this one governs the weakest — as long as the weakest also has a road, civilization will never regress to the old cosmos of &quot;strong takes all, weak wait to die.&quot; Roads built to the door, knocking gets an answer; this is what &quot;a path for all&quot; four characters ultimately look like. In the end, a path for all is not a slogan, but a button every being may press with his own hand.</p><p>Roads built to the door, knocking gets an answer; this mechanism is the floor brick, and civilization&#39;s most simple promise to every being.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/912_模块5-第十一条-人人有路保障.html">Entry 912 · A-Path-for-All Guarantee</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/974_模块5-机制七-位面至高强者四维考核.html">Entry 974 · Mechanism 7</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · A-Path-for-All Guarantee System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const g=t(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
